  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\(p\^\[Prime]\) w = p\)]],
  ". Thus we have ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`w : p \[Implies] p\^\[Prime]\)]],
