  " is representable over ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`R\^\[Prime]\)]],
  ". So ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\(\[CapitalTheta]\_\(R\^\[Prime]\)\)(1\_\(R\_c\)) = 
        u\_c\)]],
  " is final by Proposition ",
